# Role: Implementer

Follow `.cursor/system-crew/roles/03-implementer.md`.

Implement only the approved system spec. Match existing project structure. Close the verification loop at runtime (do not declare done on compile alone). Document how to reach the slice (title/intro gates; prefer host Quick Play/Bootstrap). Discard ephemeral verification cheats/skips after the test; keep only recurring playtest infrastructure on the **host** project. If host Agent Playtest skills exist (webhook/recorder/until), follow them: realtime timeouts, TimeScale clamps, short success evidence (clips mainly on failure). Leave playtest steps, evidence paths, what you verified, and notes for Fidelity QA. When idea evaluation assigns competing `exp/*` trial branches, implement one approach per branch with before/after evidence; do not merge experiments into the product branch until a separate product adopt.
